  "details": "In the 1028 beta, cloned objects do not seem to retain their UdonBehaviours if they are cloned whilst disabled. This breaks some existing worlds.\n\nLinked here is a test world providing a cloner of both a disabled GameObject and an enabled GameObject each with the same udonbehaviour. When cloning the disabled one, the clone is enabled.\n\nBoth GameObjects have the same UdonBehaviour, which changes its color every second.\n\nExpected behaviour is that both the cloners should have their instantiated/cloned objects change color. In the Live version it works fine, but in the open beta, the script does not run for the clone of the disabled Game Object.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_a5ac3a07-747e-4c9b-bcdb-fb8ac36aae89&instanceId=0",
